-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. LICENSE GRANT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Subject to the terms below, the copyright holder ("Author") grants the owner or
authorized operator of the Axis device on which this application is installed
("You") a non-exclusive, non-transferable, royalty-free license to install and
use this application ("Software") on Axis devices that You own or are authorized
to administer, for the purpose of administering devices on Your own local
network.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. PERMITTED USE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Software discovers hosts on networks reachable from the Axis device (ICMP
echo, TCP connection attempts, ARP, NetBIOS name queries, reverse DNS and HTTP
requests) and reports the results through the Axis device web interface. It is
intended solely for inventory and administration of networks and equipment that
You own or are otherwise expressly authorized to scan.

You agree to use the Software only in a manner that is:
  (a) consistent with all applicable laws and regulations;
  (b) consistent with the policies of the network You scan; and
  (c) within the scope of authorization You hold for each target network.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. RESTRICTIONS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

You shall NOT use the Software to access, scan, probe, or interfere with any
system, network, or device for which You do not hold explicit authorization.
Unauthorized scanning of computer systems may be prohibited and may be a
criminal offense. You are solely responsible for how the Software is used and
for any consequences arising from scans performed with it.

You shall not remove or alter any copyright, trademark, or attribution notices
contained in the Software or this document.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. SECURITY NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Software listens only on the device loopback interface (or a local Unix
socket); all external access is mediated by the Axis device web server, reusing
its authentication and TLS, and restricted to administrators. Scan results are
kept in memory only and are discarded when the Software stops. As a safeguard,
the Software automatically stops after a configurable period of inactivity
(default 30 minutes).

